			<item>
				<title>About</title>
				<link>https://www.manas96.github.io/about/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://www.manas96.github.io/about/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The goal is simple: record, understand, and simulate the natural world.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;interests&#34;&gt;Interests&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://manas96.github.io/tags/research/&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simulation &amp;amp; Graphics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Building mathematical models of our physical world. From path tracing to physically based simulation, the true joy lies in the complete engineering cycle—designing elegant algorithms, writing the software, and optimizing performance to the metal.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://manas96.github.io/photography/&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Photography&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Documenting the outdoors while indulging technical curiosity. It&amp;rsquo;s a constant mechanical challenge to push consumer-budget camera gear to its absolute limits and capture breathtaking phenomena.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://manas96.github.io/tags/outdoor/&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expeditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Thriving on the physical demands of hiking and cycling, always seeking the reward of a stunning view.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;experience&#34;&gt;Experience&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Current&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
